"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.4.1.stable\n4.5.stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.stable - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7640) - AMD Ryzen 9 7950X 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 63.14 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nGodot is slow to open, slow to edit, and slow to run a simple game when using Discord voice channel\n\nSimilar to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/20566 (hardware issue.)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open Godot editor and note time to launch.\n2. Download & install Discord https://discord.com/download\n3. Run discord app. Join a voice channel on any server.\n4. Open Godot and observe the delay in launch time.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNot required (simply launch Godot.)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godote